{"title":"Frontend Engineer Roadmap","role":"Frontend Engineer","summary":"A Frontend Engineer designs and develops the client-side portion of web applications and digital products. The role combines computer science, software engineering, UI/UX principles, accessibility, performance optimization, and product design.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Computer Science & Design (CSD)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Frontend Engineer designs and develops the client-side portion of web applications and digital products. The role combines computer science, software engineering, UI/UX principles, accessibility, performance optimization, and product design."},{"type":"p","text":"For a CSD graduate, the strongest positioning is to combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Programming","Web Engineering","UI/UX","Design Systems","Performance","Modern Frontend Architecture"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern frontend engineering increasingly extends beyond basic HTML/CSS/JavaScript into TypeScript, React/Next.js, component systems, testing, accessibility, web performance, APIs, cloud deployment, and AI-assisted development."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Strong demand for frontend engineers who can build production-quality responsive applications using React/TypeScript and modern tooling"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Greater emphasis on design systems, frontend architecture, performance, accessibility, AI-assisted development and full-stack collaboration"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior engineers increasingly move toward frontend architecture, platform engineering, developer experience and technical leadership"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Potential progressio